Status
------
- `mise ls`            : Installed and active tools (`-m` missing, `-c` current)
- `mise outdated`      : Tools with newer versions
- `mise doctor`        : Check the install
- `mise which <bin>` / `mise where <tool>` : Path of a tool

Install and upgrade
-------------------
- `mise install`       : Install everything in config.toml
- `mise upgrade`       : Upgrade all tools (`-i` pick, `-n` dry run)
- `mise upgrade <tool> --bump` : Upgrade and write the new version to config
- `mise use <tool>@<ver>` : Add to ./mise.toml in this directory
- `mise use -g <tool>` : Add to the global config (this repo's link/config/mise/config.toml)
- `mise x <tool>@<ver> -- <cmd>` : Run once without installing into config
- `mise self-update`   : Update mise

Find and clean
--------------
- `mise search <name>` / `mise registry` : Find a tool
- `mise ls-remote <tool>` : Versions available
- `mise prune -n` then `mise prune` : Delete unused versions
